      "verdict": "REJECTED. It changes nothing, because there is nothing in this scene three.js can light: every object is a RawShaderMaterial Points or LineLoop, or a Sprite, and three’s lighting model and scene.environment reach only its own built-in lit materials. Shadows additionally need a receiver, and a solar-system plan view has no surface. 6,348 B gzip plus a 1.6 MB download for a mean frame luminance change of 0.001, which is inside the noise of the measurement itself."
